    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00abStrike at Night\u00bb is a short first-person horror experience set in a lonely bowling alley.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/71ed1d4f1015d6317abe21421d8b1b32.poster.avif?t=1749930650\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/71ed1d4f1015d6317abe21421d8b1b32.webm?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/71ed1d4f1015d6317abe21421d8b1b32.mp4?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night janitor, your job is simple: Pick up scattered bowling balls, toss out leftovers, put things back where they belong and finish your shift. But something\u2019s off. The building doesn\u2019t feel empty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/6bdf39e5d44d9c8827704823fec4ac01.poster.avif?t=1749930650\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/6bdf39e5d44d9c8827704823fec4ac01.webm?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/6bdf39e5d44d9c8827704823fec4ac01.mp4?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve light riddles to progress, complete your tasks, and find a way out. Something is trying to stop you. Keep moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/c86ab3421a8e8ecb659442d672a34ae6.poster.avif?t=1749930650\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/c86ab3421a8e8ecb659442d672a34ae6.webm?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/c86ab3421a8e8ecb659442d672a34ae6.mp4?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The alley\u2019s cheerful mascot moves on its own. And it\u2019s not alone. Avoid what\u2019s stalking the lanes and make it to the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game ends eventually. Are you ready to throw your final ball? Don\u2019t make any mistakes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00abStrike at Night\u00bb is a short first-person horror experience set in a lonely bowling alley.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/71ed1d4f1015d6317abe21421d8b1b32.poster.avif?t=1749930650\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/71ed1d4f1015d6317abe21421d8b1b32.webm?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/71ed1d4f1015d6317abe21421d8b1b32.mp4?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night janitor, your job is simple: Pick up scattered bowling balls, toss out leftovers, put things back where they belong and finish your shift. But something\u2019s off. The building doesn\u2019t feel empty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/6bdf39e5d44d9c8827704823fec4ac01.poster.avif?t=1749930650\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/6bdf39e5d44d9c8827704823fec4ac01.webm?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/6bdf39e5d44d9c8827704823fec4ac01.mp4?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve light riddles to progress, complete your tasks, and find a way out. Something is trying to stop you. Keep moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/c86ab3421a8e8ecb659442d672a34ae6.poster.avif?t=1749930650\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/c86ab3421a8e8ecb659442d672a34ae6.webm?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806190/extras/c86ab3421a8e8ecb659442d672a34ae6.mp4?t=1749930650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The alley\u2019s cheerful mascot moves on its own. And it\u2019s not alone. Avoid what\u2019s stalking the lanes and make it to the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game ends eventually. Are you ready to throw your final ball? Don\u2019t make any mistakes.</p>",
